:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Prisoner Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Adult Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Happy New Year? (Monthly Event)|Happy New Year?]]. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update#Version 2.1.1 Update|Version 2.1.1]]. This unit is a variant of [[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Bondage Cat]] with lower health, slower attacks, but greater damage and DPS and an additional knockback. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]] grants significantly increased range and cooldown time, a slightly longer foreswing and the [[Long Distance]] ability. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Adult Cat is unlocked in the [[Rare Cat Capsule]] pool once clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] from Chapter One.

